[{"content":"You can call these tools (parameters are JSON Schema; \"required\" lists the required arguments, and \"default\" is the value used when an optional argument is left out):\n\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"getFileInfo\",\n    \"description\": \"Get the metadata of one file or directory: size, owner, permissions and timestamps.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"path\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Absolute path of the file or directory to inspect.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"path\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"deleteFile\",\n    \"description\": \"Delete one file by path; by default it is moved to the trash, where it can still be restored.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"path\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Absolute path of the file to delete, exactly as listed.\"\n        },\n        \"permanent\": {\n          \"type\": \"boolean\",\n          \"description\": \"Delete permanently instead of moving the file to the trash.\",\n          \"default\": false\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"path\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"searchFiles\",\n    \"description\": \"Find files below a directory whose names match a glob pattern, with their sizes and timestamps.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"directory\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Absolute path of the directory to search from, e.g. '/srv/reports'.\"\n        },\n        \"pattern\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Glob pattern the file name must match, e.g. '*.csv' or 'invoice-*'.\"\n        },\n        \"recursive\": {\n          \"type\": \"boolean\",\n          \"description\": \"Search subdirectories as well as the directory itself.\",\n          \"default\": true\n        },\n        \"maxResults\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"description\": \"Maximum number of matching files to return.\",\n          \"default\": 50\n        },\n        \"excludePatterns\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"description\": \"Glob patterns of file names to leave out, in any order.\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Glob pattern\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"directory\",\n        \"pattern\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"updateUserRole\",\n    \"description\": \"Change the role of one user account, which sets what the user can see and edit in the workspace.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"userId\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"description\": \"Numeric user id, e.g. 48213.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"New role for the account.\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"viewer\",\n            \"editor\",\n            \"admin\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"notifyUser\": {\n          \"type\": \"boolean\",\n          \"description\": \"Email the user about the change.\",\n          \"default\": true\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"userId\",\n        \"role\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n\nRequest: Find the files matching report-* under /mnt/shared/finance.\n\nReply with only a JSON array of the tool calls that fulfil the request, each of the form {\"name\": \"<tool name>\", \"arguments\": {...}}, where \"arguments\" is a JSON object (not a string). When the request needs several calls, list them all. Reply with [] if no tool fits the request, or if the request does not give a value for a required argument: never guess one. Include every required argument. Include an optional argument only if the request asks for a value for it; otherwise leave it out and the tool applies its default. Give each value the type its schema declares: JSON numbers for integer and number, true or false for boolean, and strings for string, copied exactly as written.","role":"user"},{"content":"[{\"name\":\"searchFiles\",\"arguments\":{\"directory\":\"/mnt/shared/finance\",\"pattern\":\"report-*\"}}]","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Tool results:\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"searchFiles\",\n    \"result\": [\n      {\n        \"path\": \"/mnt/shared/finance/invoice-20250812.pdf\",\n        \"sizeBytes\": 895706,\n        \"modified\": \"2025-01-14T09:00\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"/mnt/shared/finance/export-20251203.pdf\",\n        \"sizeBytes\": 561430,\n        \"modified\": \"2025-02-12T09:00\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"/mnt/shared/finance/report-20250209.pdf\",\n        \"sizeBytes\": 48875,\n        \"modified\": \"2025-03-13T09:00\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]\n\nRequest: Delete the oldest of those for good, don't just move it to the trash.\n\nReply as before: only a JSON array of tool calls, or [] if no tool fits or a required value is missing.","role":"user"},{"content":"[{\"name\":\"deleteFile\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"/mnt/shared/finance/invoice-20250812.pdf\",\"permanent\":true}}]","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Tool results:\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"deleteFile\",\n    \"result\": {\n      \"deleted\": \"/mnt/shared/finance/invoice-20250812.pdf\"\n    }\n  }\n]\n\nRequest: Zip the remaining two into /srv/archive/old-reports.zip.\n\nReply as before: only a JSON array of tool calls, or [] if no tool fits or a required value is missing.","role":"user"},{"content":"[]","role":"assistant"},{"content":"A new tool is now available:\n{\n  \"name\": \"compressFiles\",\n  \"description\": \"Pack a set of files into a single zip archive on the file server and return the archive's path.\",\n  \"parameters\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\":